## 🧠 Topics Covered

The laboratory work covers the implementation and application of various **data structures and algorithms**, including:

**Arrays** • **Linked Lists** • **Stacks** • **Queues** • **Trees** • **Heaps** • **Hashing** • **Graphs** • **Sorting** • **Searching** • **Algorithm Analysis**

